Movie poster artwork — tests/m03/fixtures/posters/
--------------------------------------------------

Nine images retrieved from tubitv.com's Movies page and stored at UI-thumbnail
scale (408x583 and smaller):

    bad-teacher.png                        megamind.png
    cloudy-with-a-chance-of-meatballs.jpg  now-you-see-me.jpg
    dumb-and-dumber.jpg                    rango.jpg
    furious-7.jpg                          shark-tale.jpg
    transformers.png

Each remains the property of its respective copyright holder. They appear here
for one reason: Module 3 teaches that role- and name-based locators survive a
UI restructure that breaks a CSS selector chain, and that lesson is only honest
if the fixture reproduces the real Tubi card layout — including its artwork —
rather than coloured rectangles.

